Provides: isomd5sum-dev
Conflicts: isomd5sum-dev
Replaces: isomd5sum-dev
Description: Development files for rear-isomd5sum
 Header files and static libraries for developing applications that use
 the isomd5sum library.

Package: python3-isomd5sum
Architecture: any
Depends: rear-isomd5sum (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Python 3 bindings for isomd5sum
 Python 3 bindings for the isomd5sum library, allowing implanting and
 checking of md5sums in ISO images from Python scripts.
